  "description": "YARP gateway integration for Trellis. Re-mints a per-cluster internal JWT from the full Trellis Actor (id + permissions + forbidden permissions + ABAC attributes), exposes an OIDC discovery + JWKS endpoint pair so downstream services can configure AddJwtBearer(o => o.Authority = gatewayUrl) for transparent key rotation, and emits redacted audit telemetry on every mint. Pairs with the consumer-side TrellisInternalJwtActorProvider in Trellis.Microservices.AspNetCore.",
